        summary: "After {DL}'s case in this court in {PRIORDATE} for {PRIOR}, {D} reported a walk-in cooler, a fryer and a range stolen from a new food stand and filed a $9,500 claim. Investigators found the equipment in a rented storage unit. {DL} says {D.he} moved it for safekeeping and a thief took the rest.",
