        closings: ("The service was paid for by {D}, the tournament went offline in the final, {V} lost $7,500, and with {PRIOR} behind {D.him}, {DL} knew what that service does.", "A test of a service is not an attack on a tournament. The State must prove {D} meant to take the tournament offline."),
